<title>USA: Honda June US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Honda June US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    54,126	    56,233	     -3.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,837	     4,090	    -30.6</p>
<p> Import Car		14,617	     9,420	    +55.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	     7,802	     3,148	   +147.8</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jun 30, 1997 Jan 1-Jun 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   308,467	   333,530	     -6.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  14,331	    14,170	     +1.8</p>
<p> Import Car		76,090	    58,104	    +31.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	    44,108	    17,115	   +159.4</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 153 for year to date vs 154 in year ago.</p>
</text>
